#### Decision Variables

- $x_{sc} \geq 0$ (continuous), for all $s \in S$, $c \in C$

#### Objective Function

\[
\min \sum_{s \in S} \sum_{c \in C} c_{sc} \cdot x_{sc}
\]

#### Constraints

1. **Demand Satisfaction (for each customer group):**
   \[
   \sum_{s \in S} x_{sc} = d_c, \quad \forall c \in C
   \]

2. **Supply Capacity (for each distribution center):**
   \[
   \sum_{c \in C} x_{sc} \leq u_s, \quad \forall s \in S
   \]

3. **Non-negativity:**
   \[
   x_{sc} \geq 0, \quad \forall s \in S,\, c \in C
   \]

#### Full Model

\[
\begin{align*}
\min \quad & \sum_{s \in S} \sum_{c \in C} c_{sc} \cdot x_{sc} \\
\text{s.t.} \quad & \sum_{s \in S} x_{sc} = d_c, \quad \forall c \in C \\
                  & \sum_{c \in C} x_{sc} \leq u_s, \quad \forall s \in S \\
                  & x_{sc} \geq 0, \quad \forall s \in S,\, c \in C \\
\end{align*}
\]

